         "lineHeight": "24px",
         "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
         "width": "929px",
         "marginBottom": "14.4px",
         "text": "The client is expected to arrive on time for each booked session. A cancelled or postponed appointment slows down our work and might have a negative influence on other clients. Because your appointments include the reserve of time expressly for you, and out of mutual respect for each other and our o"
        },
        {
         "tag": "h4",
         "box": [
