         "lineHeight": "24px",
         "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
         "width": "929px",
         "marginBottom": "14.4px",
         "text": "This means if your appointment is supposed to be 9am on Wednesday and you wish to cancel, we expect to have received your email by 9am on Tuesday, then we can waive the cancellation fee. If we receive your cancellation later than that, then you will be charged the cancellation fee to have another ap"
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "box": [
          40,
          868,
          929,
          24
         ],
         "fontFamily": "Poppins",
         "fontSize": "16px",
         "fontWeight": "400",
         "lineHeight": "24px",
         "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
         "width": "929px",
         "marginBottom": "14.4px",
         "text": "If you can, we would appreciate more than 24-hour notice so that we can make that time available to other clients."
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "box": [
          40,
          907,
          929,
          120
         ],
         "fontFamily": "Poppins",
         "fontSize": "16px",
         "fontWeight": "400",
         "lineHeight": "24px",
         "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
         "width": "929px",
         "marginBottom": "14.4px",
         "text": "As a result, if you find out before the mandatory 24-hour notice that you will be unable to attend our session, please send an email so that we can fill your slot and place another client in your space who may require it. Counseling appointments are designated exclusively for our clients and are boo"
        },
        {
