         "fontSize": "16px",
         "fontWeight": "400",
         "lineHeight": "24px",
         "color": "rgb(46, 46, 46)",
         "width": "929px",
         "marginBottom": "14.4px",
         "text": "This cancellation policy is only waived in the event of a serious sickness or emergency. Car accidents, family deaths, and severe illness are all examples of emergencies. In this case, if you are not physically able to cancel your appointment, you can get someone to write us an email on your behalf."
        },
        {
